#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "For Users with Disabilities"
msgstr "Para Usuarios con Discapacidades"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This section of the documentation discusses accessibility features in "
"&kspread; for users with disabilities. Some of these features apply to &kde; "
"as a whole and are controlled from <ulink url=\"help:kcontrol"
"\">&kcontrolcenter;</ulink>. Some apply to all &koffice; applications, and "
"some are specific to &kspread;."
msgstr ""
"Esta sección da documentación trata acerca da acesibilidade en &kspread; "
"para usuarios con discapacidades. Algunhas destas funcionalidades aplícanse "
"a todo &kde; e son controladas co <ulink url=\"help:kcontrol"
"\">&kcontrolcenter;</ulink>. Algunhas aplícanse a todos os programas de "
"&koffice;, e algunhas son específicas de &kspread;."

#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "Installing the <command>kdeaccessibility</command> Module"
msgstr "Instalación do Módulo <command>kdeaccessibility</command>"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "kdeaccessibility"
msgstr "kdeaccessibility"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most of the features described in this chapter are enabled by installing the "
"<command>kdeaccessibility</command> module. The <command>kdeaccessibility</"
"command> module is part of the &kde; project <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org"
"\">http://www.kde.org</ulink>. The <command>kdeaccessibility</command> "
"package can be obtained from &kde-ftp;, the main ftp site of the &kde; "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Algunhas das funcionalidades descritas neste capítulo son activadas ao "
"instalar o módulo <command>kdeaccessibility</command>. Este módulo é parte "
"do proxecto &kde; <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</"
"ulink>. O paquete <command>kdeaccessibility</command> pode ser obtido en "
"&kde-ftp;, o sitio ftp principal do proxecto &kde;."

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many distributions offer precompiled binaries on their ftp sites. Please "
"check your distribution's web sites for more information."
msgstr ""
"Algunhas distribuizóns oferecen executábeis precompilados nos seus sitios "
"ftp. Verifique o sitio web da súa distribuizón para mais información."

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"More information about &kde; accessibility can be obtained by visiting "
"<ulink url=\"http://accessibility.kde.org/\">http://accessibility.kde.org/</"
"ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Pode obter mais información acerca de &kde; acesibilidade visitando <ulink "
"url=\"http://accessibility.kde.org/\">http://accessibility.kde.org/</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Visual Impairments</title>"
msgstr "<title>Discapacidades Visuais</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Visual Impairments</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Discapacidades Visuais</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kspread; is not usable by totally blind users. It is hoped that a general "
"screen reader for the blind will be available in future versions of &kde;."
msgstr ""
"&kspread; non é usábel polos usuarios completamente cegos. Esperamos ter "
"disponíbel un leitor xeral de pantalla para cegos en versións futuras de "
"&kde;."

#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Theming</title>"
msgstr "<title>Temas</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Theming</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Temas</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For low-sighted or light allergic users, several features are available in "
"the &kcontrolcenter; <menuchoice><guimenu>Appearance &amp; Themes</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Theme Manager</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, like high "
"contrast color themes. If you are light allergic, the "
"<guilabel>HighContrastDark</guilabel> or <guilabel>HighContrastLight</"
"guilabel> themes may be helpful. If you have difficulty reading small fonts "
"or seeing small icons, the <guilabel>HighContrastDark-big</guilabel> or "
"<guilabel>HighContrastLight-big</guilabel> themes will increase the size of "
"text, buttons, and icons. You may also customize background, colors, fonts, "
"and icons from the same dialog. A set of monochrome icons is available."
msgstr ""
"Para os usuarios con pouca vista ou alérxicos á luz, hai disponíbeis varias "
"funcionalidades no &kcontrolcenter; <menuchoice><guimenu>Aparencia &amp; "
"Temas</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Xestor de Temas</guimenuitem></menuchoice>, "
"como temas de alto contraste. Se é alérxico á luz, os temas "
"<guilabel>HighContrastDark</guilabel> ou <guilabel>HighContrastLight</"
"guilabel> poderán serlle de axuda. Se ten dificuldades lento letras cativas "
"ou ao ver ícones pequenos, os temas <guilabel>HighContrastDark-big</"
"guilabel> ou <guilabel>HighContrastLight-big</guilabel> aumentaranlle o "
"tamaño dos textos, botóns e ícones. Tamén poderá personalizar o fondo, "
"cores, tipos de letra e ícones no mesmo diálogo. Hai disponíbel un conxunto "
"de ícones monocromos."

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose one of the <guilabel>Big</guilabel> themes, you may discover "
"that some windows are too large to fit your monitor. Purchasing a larger "
"monitor will be helpful. You can drag the portions of the window not visible "
"into the visible area by holding down the &Alt; key and dragging with the "
"&LMB; anywhere within the screen. If you have trouble operating a mouse, you "
"can also move screens by pressing <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;"
"<keycap>F3</keycap></keycombo>. In the dropdown Windows Operations Menu, "
"choose <menuchoice><guimenuitem>Move</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Move the "
"screen with the arrow keys and press &Esc; to finish the move."
msgstr ""
"Se escolle un dos temas <guilabel>Grandes</guilabel>, pode achar que "
"algunhas xanelas non couben no seu monitor. Mercar un mais grande será de "
"axuda. Pode arrastar partes da xanela non visíbeis para a área visíbel "
"mantendo a tecla &Alt; premida e arrastando co &LMB; para calquer parte da "
"pantalla. Se ten problemas ao usar un rato, tamén poderá mover as xanelas "
"premendo <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F3</keycap></keycombo>. No "
"menú de Operacións na Xanels, escolla <menuchoice><guimenuitem>Mover</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. Mova a xanela cos cursores e prema &Esc; para "
"acabar de desprazar."

#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kmagnifier;"
msgstr "&kmagnifier;"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "magnifier"
msgstr "ampliación"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <command>kdeaccessibility</command> module includes a screen magnifier "
"application called <ulink url=\"help:kmag\">&kmagnifier;</ulink>. If it is "
"installed, you can run it from <menuchoice><guimenu>K-Button</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Utilities</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>KMag (Screen "
"Magnifier)</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"O módulo <command>kdeaccessibility</command> inclúi un programa de "
"ampliación da pantall chamado <ulink url=\"help:kmag\">&kmagnifier;</ulink>. "
"Se está instalado, podera-o executar desde <menuchoice><guimenu>Menú K</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Utilidades</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>KMag (Ampliación "
"da Pantalla)</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Text-to-Speech</title>"
msgstr "<title>Texto-para-Fala</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Text-to-Speech</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Texto-para-Fala</primary>"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>TTS</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>TTS</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <command>kdeaccessibility</command> module includes a Text-to-Speech "
"component called KTTS. If KTTS is installed, you can configure &kspread; to "
"speak the text that is under the mouse pointer or speak the text of each "
"screen widget as it receives focus. Before using this feature, first "
"configure KTTS. See <ulink url=\"help:kttsd\">The KTTS Handbook</ulink> for "
"details. To turn on the TTS feature in &kspread;, select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kspread;...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menubar. This will display a dialog box. "
"Clicking on <guilabel>TTS</guilabel> will allow you to change the following."
msgstr ""
"O módulo <command>kdeaccessibility</command> inclúi un componente de Texto-"
"para-Fala chamado KTTS. Se ten KTTS instalado, pode configurar &kspread; "
"para que fale o texto que estexa baixo o ponteiro do rato ou que fale o "
"texto de cada elemento da xanela que receba o foco. Antes de usar esta "
"funcionalidade, configure KTTS. Consulte <ulink url=\"help:kttsd\">O Manual "
"de KTTS</ulink> para mais detalles. Para activar o Texto-para-Fala en "
"&kspread;, escolla <menuchoice> <guimenu>Configuración</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configurar &kspread;...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> no "
"menú. Mostrarase un diálogo. Se preme en <guilabel>TTS</guilabel> poderá "
"mudar o seguinte."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: a11y.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Speak widget under mouse pointer"
msgstr "Falar o elemento baixo o rato"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When checked, &kspread; will speak the text of each widget as the mouse "
"pointer moves over the widget."
msgstr ""
"Cando estexa sinalado, &kspread; dirá o texto de cada elemento sobre o que "
"pase o ponteiro do rato."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: a11y.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "Speak widget with focus"
msgstr "Falar o elemento focalizado"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When checked, &kspread; will speak the text of each widget as it receives "
"focus."
msgstr ""
"Cando estexa sinalado, &kspread; dirá o texto do elemento que receba o foco."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: a11y.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "Speak tool tips"
msgstr "Falar as axudiñas"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When checked, &kspread; will speak the popup tool tip for each widget in "
"addition to the text of the widget."
msgstr ""
"Cando estexa sinalado, &kspread; dirá o texto das axudas emerxentes dos "
"elementos a maiores do texto de cada elemento."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: a11y.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "Speak What's This"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When checked, &kspread; will speak the <quote>What's This?</quote> help for "
"each widget in addition to the text of the widget."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: a11y.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Say whether disabled"
msgstr "Dicer se está deshabilitado"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When checked, &kspread; will speak the word \"disabled\" if the widget is "
"currently disabled (grayed)."
msgstr ""
"Cando estexa sinalado, &kspread; dirá a palabra \"deshabilitado\" se o "
"elemento está deshabilitado (en gris)."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: a11y.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "Speak accelerators"
msgstr "Dicer os atallos"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When checked, &kspread; will speak the accelerator of the widget in addition "
"to the text of the widget. Accelerators are the underlined letters you see "
"in the text of the widget. For example, in the main menu, the "
"<menuchoice><guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item has the "
"\"Q\" underlined. You can choose it by pressing <keycap>Q</keycap>. To speak "
"the accelerator, check this option and enter the word you want to speak "
"before the accelerator in the <guilabel>Prefaced by the word</guilabel> box. "
"In this example shown above, &kspread; will speak \"Accelerator Q\"."
msgstr ""
"Cando estexa sinalado, &kspread; dirá o atallo de teclado do elemento "
"ademais do texto do elemento. Os atallos son as letras subraiadas que vé no "
"texto do elemento. Por exemplo, no menú principal, o ítem "
"<menuchoice><guimenuitem>Sair</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> ten o \"Q\" "
"subraiado. Pode escolle-lo premendo <keycap>Q</keycap>. Para dicer o "
"acelerador, sinale esta opción e escreba no campo <guilabel>Antecedida pola "
"palabra</guilabel> a palabra que queira ouvir antes do atallo. No exemplo "
"mostrado acima, &kspread; dirá \"Atallo Q\"."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: a11y.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "Polling interval"
msgstr "Intervalo de Enquisa"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option determines how often &kspread; will check for a change in the "
"widget under the mouse pointer or a new focused widget. You should leave "
"this option on the default setting."
msgstr ""
"Esta opción determina canto a miúdo ha verificar &kspread; que se producise "
"un cambio no elemento baixo o rato ou un novo elemento focalizado. Debera "
"deixar o valor predefinido."

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the <guibutton>TTS</guibutton> option does not appear on this screen, you "
"do not have the KTTS component installed in your system."
msgstr ""
"Se a opción <guibutton>TTS</guibutton> non aparece na súa pantalla, é que "
"non ten a componente KTTS instalada."

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Not all widgets are spoken. For example, the items on the main menubar are "
"not spoken."
msgstr ""
"Non todos os elementos son falados. Por exemplo, os da barra de menú "
"principal no son falados."

#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "Motor Impairments and Mouseless Operation"
msgstr "Discapacidades Motrices e Manexo Sen Rato"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid "Motor Impairments"
msgstr "Discapacidades Motrices"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mouseless Operation"
msgstr "Manexo Sen Rato"

#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kmousetool;"
msgstr "&kmousetool;"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you can operate a mouse, but have trouble clicking, the <ulink url=\"help:"
"kmousetool\">&kmousetool;</ulink> application may help. Run it from "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>K-Button</guimenu><guimenuitem>Utilities</guimenuitem> "
"<guimenuitem>KMouseTool (Automatik Mouse Click)</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "XAccess Features"
msgstr "Funcionalidades XAccess"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid "XAccess"
msgstr "XAccess"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Sticky Keys</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Teclas Pegoñentas</primary>"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Slow Keys</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Teclas Lentas</primary>"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Bounce Keys</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Rebote de Teclas</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kcontrolcenter; offers several keyboard features collectively called "
"XAccess. They include:"
msgstr ""
"O &kcontrolcenter; oferece varias funcionalidades para o teclado que en "
"conxunto son denominadas XAccess. Inclúen:"

#. Tag: term
#: a11y.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Sticky Keys</term>"
msgstr "<term>Teclas Pegoñentas</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This feature permits operation of meta keys, such as &Alt;, &Ctrl;, and "
"&Shift; without having to hold the keys down. It is useful when you can only "
"use one finger or one hand to operate the keyboard. With Sticky Keys on, "
"press and release a &Alt;, &Ctrl;, or &Shift; key, then press another key. "
"The result is as if you pressed both keys at once. Press the &Alt;, &Ctrl;, "
"or &Shift; key again to turn off the sticky key. Activate this feature in "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>K-Button</guimenu><guimenuitem>&kcontrolcenter;</"
"guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Regional &amp; Accessibility</"
"guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Accessibility</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Modifier "
"Keys</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Esta funcionalidade permite usar meta-teclas, tais como &Alt;, &Ctrl; e "
"&Shift; sen ter que mante-las premidas. É útil se só pode usar un dedo ou "
"unha mao para manexar o teclado. Se activa as teclas pegoñentas, prema e "
"solte &Alt;, &Ctrl; ou &Shift;, e logo prema outra tecla. O resultado é como "
"se tivese mantido ambas as dúas teclas premidas á vez. Prema de novo &Alt;, "
"&Ctrl; ou &Shift; para anular a tecla pegañenta. Pode activar esta "
"funcionalidade en <menuchoice><guimenu>Menú K</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>&kcontrolcenter;</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Rexional "
"&amp; Acesibilidade</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Acesibilidade</"
"guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Teclas Modificadoras</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."

#. Tag: term
#: a11y.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Slow Keys</term>"
msgstr "<term>Teclas Lentas</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This feature is useful if you have hand tremors or difficulty accurately "
"pressing keys. It prevents inadvertent key presses by requiring that a key "
"be held down for a minimum time before it is accepted. Activate this feature "
"in <menuchoice><guimenu>K-Button</guimenu><guimenuitem>&kcontrolcenter;</"
"guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Regional &amp; Accessibility</"
"guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Accessibility</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Keyboard "
"Filters</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Esta funcionalidade é útil se lle tremen as maos ou ten dificuldades para "
"premer con precisión. Evita que prema teclas por equivocación xa que requere "
"que a tecla sexa premida durante un mínimo de tempo antes de ser aceitada. "
"Pode activar esta funcionalidade en <menuchoice><guimenu>Menú K</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>&kcontrolcenter;</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Rexional &amp; "
"Acesibilidade</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Acesibilidade</guimenuitem> "
"<guimenuitem>Filtros de Teclado</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: term
#: a11y.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>Bounce Keys</term>"
msgstr "<term>Rebote de Teclas</term>"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This feature is also useful if you have hand tremors. It prevents "
"inadvertent repeated key presses by preventing another keystroke for a "
"certain amount of time. Activate this feature in <menuchoice><guimenu>K-"
"Button</guimenu><guimenuitem>&kcontrolcenter;</guimenuitem> "
"<guimenuitem>Regional &amp; Accessibility</"
"guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Accessibility</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Keyboard "
"Filters</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Esta funcionalidade tamén é útil se lle tremen as maos. Evita que faga "
"pulsazóns repetidas ao rexeitar repeticións de teclas durante un certo "
"tempo. Pode activar esta funcionalidade en <menuchoice><guimenu>Menú K</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>&kcontrolcenter;</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Rexional "
"&amp; Acesibilidade</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Acesibilidade</guimenuitem> "
"<guimenuitem>Filtros de Teclado</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Mouse Emulation</title>"
msgstr "<title>Simulazón do Rato</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Mouse Emulation</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Simulazón do Rato</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Mouse Emulation permits you to move and click the mouse using the keyboard. "
"Press <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>F12</keycap></keycombo> to activate it. Use the "
"arrow keys to move the mouse pointer to the desired location, and press "
"<keycap>spacebar</keycap> to \"click\" the mouse. Unfortunately, you cannot "
"use Mouse Emulation to perform &RMB; clicks or dragging."
msgstr ""
"A simulazón do rato permítelle mover e premer o rato mediante o teclado. "
"Prema <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>F12</keycap></keycombo> para activa-lo. Use os "
"cursores para mover o ponteiro do rato para a localización desexada, e prema "
"<keycap>barra espaciadora</keycap> para \"premer\" o rato. Desgrazadamente, "
"non pode usar a Simulación do Rato para premer o &RMB; ou arrastar."

#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Mouse Navigation</title>"
msgstr "<title>Navegación co Rato</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: a11y.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Mouse Navigation</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Navegación co Rato</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:251
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This feature permits you to emulate the mouse using the numeric keypad of "
"your keyboard. To activate it, go to <menuchoice><guimenu>K-Button</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>&kcontrolcenter;</guimenuitem> "
"<guimenuitem>Peripherals</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Mouse</guimenuitem> "
"<guimenuitem>Mouse Navigation</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Check the "
"<guilabel>Move pointer with keyboard (using the num pad)</guilabel> box. "
"When you do this, the other settings will become enabled, and you can "
"customize the keyboard pointer behavior further, if required. The various "
"keys on the number pad move in the direction you would expect. Note that you "
"can move diagonally as well as up, down, left and right. The <keycap>5</"
"keycap> key emulates a click to a pointer button, typically &LMB;. You "
"change which button is emulated by using the <keycap>/</keycap> key (which "
"makes it &LMB;), <keycap>*</keycap> key (which makes it middle mouse button) "
"and <keycap>-</keycap> (which makes it &RMB;). Using the <keycap>+</keycap> "
"emulates a doubleclick to the selected pointer button. You can use the "
"<keycap>0</keycap> key to emulate holding down the selected pointer button "
"(for easy dragging), and then use the <keycap>.</keycap> to emulate "
"releasing the selected pointer button."
msgstr ""
"Esta funcionalidade permítelle simular o rato mediante o teclado numérico. "
"Para activa-lo, use <menuchoice><guimenu>Menú K</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>&kcontrolcenter;</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Periféricos</"
"guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Rato</guimenuitem><guimenuitem>Navegación co Rato</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. Sinale a opción <guilabel>Mover o rato co "
"teclado numérico</guilabel>. Se fai isto, as outras opcións serán activadas, "
"e poderá personalizar mais aínda o comportamento do rato, se o precisa. As "
"teclas do teclado numérico moverán na dirección esperada. Lembre que tamén "
"pode mover en diagonal ademais de cara riba, en baixo, á esquerda ou á "
"direita. A tecla <keycap>5</keycap> simula un clique tipicamente co &LMB;. "
"Pode alterar o botón que é simulado mediante a tecla <keycap>/</keycap> (que "
"a fai &LMB;), <keycap>*</keycap> (botón central do rato) e <keycap>-</"
"keycap> (&RMB;). O <keycap>+</keycap> simula un duplo-clique no botón "
"escollido. pode usar o 0 para simular o manter premido o botón escollido "
"(para facilitar o arrastar), e logo usar <keycap>.</keycap> para simular o "
"soltar o botón."

#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Atallos de teclado"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the <keycap>Menu</keycap> key to pop up the context menu. On most "
"keyboards, the <keycap>Menu</keycap> key is on the righthand side of the "
"keyboard between the <keycap>&Windows;</keycap> and &Ctrl; keys. It has a "
"menu icon on it."
msgstr ""
"Use a tecla <keycap>Menú</keycap> para mostrar o menú contextual. Na maioría "
"dos teclados, a tecla de <keycap>Menú</keycap> está á direita do teclado "
"entre as teclas <keycap>&Windows;</keycap> e &Ctrl;. Ten un ícone de menú "
"nela."

#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resizing panels"
msgstr "Mudar o tamaño dos paneis"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have activated two or more views of a spreadsheet, you can move the "
"sizing bar between the views by pressing <keycap>F8</keycap>. A sizing icon "
"appears overtop the sizing bar. Use the arrow keys to move the bar up or "
"down, or left or right. Press <keycap>F8</keycap> again or &Esc; when "
"finished sizing."
msgstr ""
"Se ten activas dúas ou mais vistas dunha folla de cálculo, pode mover a "
"barra que as separa premendo <keycap>F8</keycap>. Aparecerá un ícone de "
"mudanza de tamaño sobre a barra de tamaño. Use os cursores para mover a "
"barra cara riba ou baixo, ou á esquerda ou direita. Prema <keycap>F8</"
"keycap> de novo ou &Esc; para rematar de mudar o tamaño."

#. Tag: title
#: a11y.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting focus to widgets"
msgstr "Focalizar Elementos"

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Normally, one can use the &Tab; and <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Shift;&Tab;</"
"keycombo> to move focus from one widget to the next in any application. "
"However, in &kspread;, pressing &Tab; does not move the focus; instead it "
"moves the cell selection forwards. You can set focus to any widget that can "
"receive focus by pressing <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F8</"
"keycap></keycombo>. A small lettered box appears overtop each widget on the "
"screen that can receive focus."
msgstr ""
"Polo xera, pode usar &Tab; e <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Shift;&Tab;</"
"keycombo> para mover o foco dun elemento para o próximo en calquer programa. "
"Porén, en &kspread; se preme &Tab; non moverá o foco: no lugar moverá para "
"outra cela. Pode darlle o foco a calquer elemento que poda recebe-lo "
"premendo <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F8</keycap></keycombo>. Ha "
"aparecer unha pequena caixa cunha letra sobre cada elemento na pantalla que "
"poda receber o foco."

#. Tag: para
#: a11y.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press the letter to move focus to the corresponding widget. Press <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F8</keycap></keycombo> again or &Esc; to "
"abandon moving the focus."
msgstr ""
"Prema a letra para mover o foco para o elemento correspondente. Prema "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F8</keycap></keycombo> de novo ou "
"&Esc; para sair de mover o foco."
